# head/adult/woman/expr: the woman's expressions, overlays at the face (blink, hurt, closed, talk, fierce)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); every head type keeps A3's eye and mouth rows, so these fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role expr fierce
role expr blink
role expr hurt
role expr closed
role expr talk
layer face
anchor head
keys expr
z 2
tags overlay mirror-ok

